    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c035ba4130a1e8de5bccd70",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "击退了林立的强敌，甚至甩开了宿敌迷人景致，\n现在，红色梦想率先冲线！！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "41dcde37611d01ced562f93f3a7236eee429ef566e03cadb8d3e3ea923fbd0c4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136319.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        10,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/10/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e9c3dca3ea4803032972f634",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "圣女红色梦想将名为宿命的\n沉重压迫全部转化为力量，\n终于，攀登上了这个世界的顶峰。",
      "source_fingerprint": "107dec1980fe8e11bc6846f89dea55839c05ef52141ecd1f5a0bac601ba7b8a2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136319.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        11,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/11/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fbf9060c0b29e0a0cdcd3905",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "看着那神圣的身影……\n自己的眼前，仿佛浮现出了未来的幻象。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1fccf152b96573978fb17c3962392a3852365f22068c5106aee028630aef0124",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136319.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        12,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/12/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e2b81625cb92b491fee5c8cf",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "大洋的彼岸――\n那座一直以来令人无限憧憬的赛场。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6de14857bb6b9a8fcffa2e3c459c9ca7de2325989d672a00ffa8fb3f64cfddf4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136319.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        13,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/13/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c3235c3c0526d4205b913135",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在世界顶级舞台『育马者杯』上，\n红色梦想如同今天一般\n屹立于顶点的姿态。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2bd520e05a918356d15f6a915bcdcc382c2c1755b8589820305e4b34639f8c48",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136319.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        14,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/14/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fce3948a76c3090063bdf280",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "梦想……梦想！！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fac9af7f5fb04ec0798e5042de53adb96465fc8992f8a77367e5a55bb617e4f1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136319.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        15,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/15/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:64970495e2b0cc64812c17d1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "哪怕是面对『育马者杯』的舞台，她也能将其\n视作至高无上的试炼去应战，并最终战胜它，\n从而达成历史性壮举的那一瞬间――！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb538a4d6f482d543e9f48abcbcb5693c73b30d257e14cc0a35de02e5b2d3d0c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136319.json",
      "json_path": [
